This test produce a swarm of NE alchemical trajectories
for solvated FKB12 with ligand using the OpenMP/MPI 
(2 threads 4 MPI process) 

The input file is alchmey.in
the starting conf are the files in the restart-dir produced by test2
potential parameters are read from the tpgprm file produced in test1

To run this test  just do form this directory 

mpirun -n 4 ../../src/GNU-FFTW-OMP-MPI/orac < alchemy.in > alchemy.out

The test should produce the directories TST0001-4 containing the output for the
four NE runs 

each dir contains the following

1.5.wrk     work data file 
ij4i.xyz    protein-ligand xyz file trajectory 
md_1.pdb    full system pdb  trajectory
out0001     general output for the NE MPI instance 

Reference output is in the directories PAR0001-4
